      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunriver%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Great Hall in Sunriver is a preserved native wood and stone structure that originally served as an officers' mess hall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
